{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49575","headline":"木兰花 · 毛熙震","name":"木兰花","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掩朱扉，钩翠箔，满院莺声春寂寞。\n匀粉泪，恨檀郎，一去不归花又落。\n对斜晖，临小阁，前事岂堪重想着。\n金带冷，画屏幽，宝帐慵熏兰麝薄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"毛熙震","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49575.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49575","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}